# Route: guide 40 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 58, 48 quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens, Un'Goro Crater, Swamp of Sorrows): The Crossroads -> Far
# Watch Post -> The Crossroads -> Thorn Hill -> Far Watch Post -> Ratchet ->
# The Merchant Coast -> Ratchet -> The Merchant Coast -> Raptor Grounds ->
# Ratchet -> The Crossroads -> The Forgotten Pools -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Nothing But The Truth (1383;
# Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher 39-40).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981).

